      "section_type": "Reading",
      "title": "Human Languages",
      "content": "Language is a wonderful system of communication. There are about seven thousand languages in the world today. Some languages have millions of speakers, while others have only a few hundred. Sign language is also a rich visual language used by deaf communities to express thoughts and emotions."
    },
    {
      "lesson_num": 2,
      "section_type": "Reading",
      "title": "Having a Healthy Lifestyle",
      "content": "A healthy lifestyle means taking care of both mind and body. Eating fresh fruits, vegetables, and whole grains keeps you energetic. Regular physical exercise prevents heart problems. Also, getting enough sleep and avoiding stress help you maintain mental wellness."
    }
